01:31.900 --> 01:33.570
Catch anything,

01:33.570 --> 01:35.540
Ichigo Saitou-san?

01:35.540 --> 01:37.330
Tch. Not you again.

01:37.800 --> 01:40.390
I'm no agency president anymore.

01:40.390 --> 01:41.470
What's the problem?

01:41.470 --> 01:45.640
You saw Ai as a daughter, and now 
her daughter's coming to see you.

01:46.120 --> 01:47.840
I know you're delighted deep down.

01:47.840 --> 01:50.480
I'm telling you to leave me alone.

01:51.180 --> 01:52.760
You're not getting away.

01:52.760 --> 01:56.370
After all, you were the one 
closest to Mom,

01:56.370 --> 01:58.470
which means you're the one 
closest to the truth.

02:00.530 --> 02:05.100
I'm not letting you get away 
until I find out who killed her.

02:05.940 --> 02:08.480
Tell me who my father is.

02:08.830 --> 02:11.390
Like I keep saying, I don't know.

02:12.000 --> 02:15.420
If I knew, I would've killed him myself.

02:16.470 --> 02:20.040
Then give me the contact details of 
everyone who was involved with her!

02:20.040 --> 02:21.190
Hell no!

02:21.190 --> 02:23.910
I know you'd just go pester 
every one of them!

02:24.720 --> 02:29.420
Even the bottom-feeders of sixteen 
years ago will be big shots now.

02:29.680 --> 02:34.900
If you go and get on their bad side, 
who d'you think'll face the brunt of it?

02:34.900 --> 02:38.150
You know it's Miyako who's running 
Strawberry Productions now.

02:39.050 --> 02:42.060
I'm starting to become 
a big name myself, okay?

02:42.060 --> 02:45.240
Yeah, right. Compared to other 
underground idols, maybe.

02:45.240 --> 02:48.310
You're so unknown that if you 
got caught underage drinking,

02:48.310 --> 02:50.680
not even the sleaziest tabloids 
would bother covering it.

02:51.390 --> 02:54.280
Then will you introduce me 
once I'm more popular?

02:56.530 --> 02:59.690
If I become a big enough name 
that <i>they</i> want to see <i>me</i>,

02:59.690 --> 03:01.210
you'll introduce us, right?

03:02.670 --> 03:03.620
Sure.

03:04.080 --> 03:06.370
Remember that. It's a promise.

03:08.580 --> 03:10.820
Okay, now teach me how to promote myself.

03:10.820 --> 03:13.550
Use your own brain for once.

03:13.550 --> 03:15.380
You used my idea last time, too.

03:15.630 --> 03:20.400
Oh, right! I did what you said, 
and I landed the reporter gig!

03:20.400 --> 03:22.130
On <i>Dig Deep! Chase the Impawsible</i>?!

03:22.130 --> 03:25.960
Way to go! That show has a lot 
of industry eyeballs on it!

03:25.960 --> 03:28.590
If you make your mark, 
you'll land more gigs...

03:31.140 --> 03:32.240
