03:33.250 --> 03:38.820
You know, I trust your skills. 
You once ran a talent agency.

03:39.690 --> 03:43.540
B-Komachi went from a no-name idol group 
to almost performing at the Tokyo Dome.

03:43.540 --> 03:46.470
And I don't think it was just 
Mom who took them there.

03:47.410 --> 03:50.750
Tell me. What do I have to do 
to become a bigger name?

03:52.510 --> 03:56.220
You won't get anywhere 
if you don't perform when called upon.

03:56.760 --> 03:59.830
Make your character stand out on the show.

03:57.070 --> 03:59.180
Ruby here, reporting from the scene!

03:59.180 --> 04:01.890
I'm coming to you live today!

