18:39.640 --> 18:44.850
<b>Chill Chatting</b>

18:40.610 --> 18:44.850
<i>Mimi's VTuber name is Suzune Komimi. 
She has over 300K subscribers.</i>

18:45.640 --> 18:50.610
<i>I got worried about my sister, 
who was a shut-in doing cosplay streams,</i>

18:50.900 --> 18:55.100
<i>so I told her to give VTubing, which was 
just getting popular back then, a shot.</i>

18:56.130 --> 18:59.880
<i>Three years have passed 
with me acting as her manager,</i>

18:59.880 --> 19:03.080
<i>and now she does gaming streams 
pretty much every day.</i>

19:03.540 --> 19:06.980
I know your old cosplay 
account is still active!

19:03.950 --> 19:09.250
<b>Nekomimi</b>

19:03.950 --> 19:09.250
<b>Nekomimi</b>

19:03.950 --> 19:09.250
<b>Good Morning China Dress <3</b>

19:03.950 --> 19:09.250
<b>Nekomimi</b>

19:03.950 --> 19:09.250
<b>I'll make this another purr-fect day <3</b>

19:06.980 --> 19:09.250
You upload home cosplay pics 
every now and then!

19:10.110 --> 19:11.650
How do you know that?!

19:11.650 --> 19:13.460
How could I not? I'm your big brother.

19:13.460 --> 19:15.180
You even cosplayed Tsurugi, right?

19:15.560 --> 19:18.340
I've seen how much you 
bitch about me on here,

19:18.340 --> 19:21.830
but if you go on the show, 
I'll forget about all of it.

19:22.630 --> 19:25.140
Th-That's so unfair.

19:25.630 --> 19:28.100
How's it going? 
Did you get enough cosplayers?

19:28.100 --> 19:30.340
Uh, somehow.

19:30.340 --> 19:33.610
Minami Kotobuki-san's agency 
gave us the go-ahead, too.

19:33.610 --> 19:35.360
We'll be okay, I think.

19:35.810 --> 19:38.070
Yeah? Glad to hear it.

19:38.070 --> 19:40.120
Who'll I be cosplaying as on the day?

19:40.120 --> 19:43.070
A <i>Tokyo Blade</i> side character.

19:43.070 --> 19:44.620
Oh, wow!

19:44.620 --> 19:46.580
Getting perms for that 
must've been a hassle.

19:47.400 --> 19:48.870
I guess?

19:48.870 --> 19:51.300
I don't handle that stuff, though.

19:51.300 --> 19:53.550
My brother was saying...

19:54.270 --> 19:57.540
<i>Tokyo Blade</i> is notoriously hard 
to get perms for.

19:58.010 --> 20:01.610
Abiko-sensei, the creator, 
is really difficult to please,

20:01.610 --> 20:04.440
so her editor turns down most requests.

20:06.060 --> 20:08.190
Huh... Really?

20:09.710 --> 20:13.150
<i>I'd better check, just in case.</i>

20:14.400 --> 20:17.860
Here's a list of the cosplayers 
we'll be interviewing tomorrow.

20:17.860 --> 20:19.370
Ooh.

20:20.460 --> 20:22.660
This one's cute.

20:22.660 --> 20:27.060
Oh, she's from Kureha's agency. 
No wonder she's stacked.

20:27.990 --> 20:29.350
I like this one, too.

20:29.350 --> 20:32.090
Yoshizumi? She has the 
same last name as you.

20:35.480 --> 20:40.050
So, uh... I just want to 
confirm one last time.

20:41.150 --> 20:44.180
Are we good to go with the 
<i>Tokyo Blade</i> cosplays tomorrow?

20:44.830 --> 20:46.240
Do we have the green light?

20:48.200 --> 20:50.260
Actually, I dunno.

20:50.260 --> 20:51.190
Huh?

20:51.190 --> 20:52.190
Hang on a sec.

20:53.690 --> 20:56.360
Urushibara here. 
Sorry for calling out of the blue.

20:56.360 --> 21:00.450
It's about the <i>Tokyo Blade</i> 
perms we talked about.

21:01.310 --> 21:02.080
Right.

21:03.070 --> 21:06.380
Oh, is that so? Got it!

21:07.940 --> 21:10.700
Yes, we'll be okay. Goodbye.

21:12.320 --> 21:14.670
Yeah, we didn't get perms.

21:14.670 --> 21:17.670
H-Hey, that changes everything!

21:17.670 --> 21:21.010
I've asked all the cosplayers 
to wear <i>Tokyo Blade</i> costumes!

21:21.290 --> 21:23.720
Just have them wear something else!

21:24.280 --> 21:26.180
At the last second?

21:26.180 --> 21:31.500
And I told you I'd ask for perms but 
to have a backup plan just in case!

21:32.510 --> 21:34.440
<i>He never said that!</i>

21:34.440 --> 21:37.380
Anyway, contact the cosplayers.

21:37.380 --> 21:39.900
Have them wear original 
or free-to-use costumes.

21:40.630 --> 21:43.910
Ask them to make it like 
<i>Tokyo Blade</i> but slightly different.

21:44.220 --> 21:44.980
Okay?

21:49.620 --> 21:52.670
What the heck? 
Bit late for that, don't you think?

21:53.150 --> 21:55.330
We don't have a choice.

21:55.330 --> 21:58.500
I'm sending apologies 
left and right now...

21:59.420 --> 22:01.220
What do we do about Ruby-chan's costume?!

22:01.690 --> 22:04.930
There's no way we can make 
a new costume now, okay?

22:05.190 --> 22:08.650
But I can't put a cast member 
in just any costume!

22:13.100 --> 22:14.650
Oh, for crying out loud.

22:15.240 --> 22:18.360
I have some free-size costumes! Use those!

22:18.800 --> 22:21.200
How tall is she?

22:21.200 --> 22:22.820
Sorry! You're a lifesaver!

